{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1000_p", "source_sha256": "03f12bcce8894a34d92cf9a37e43f1ce3a830b4b12cf30bbbae61b586ca6c9c2", "ja": "（今回の衣装は『綿あめの国のお姫様』という\nコンセプトだ。響に試着をしてもらっているが……）", "zh": "（这次的服装理念是“棉花糖王国的公主”。现在让响试穿看看，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "6e698a7f9ee66117946651ca6d6172ef2384e2744468126e81b12ecb3c97f0ce", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\n衣装、着てみたんだけど、どうどう？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n我试穿了这套服装，怎么样怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1002_p", "source_sha256": "131b9a342a55137b4f6636e990933694f54a3f74cb8953f25ee0b93ced2f75a0", "ja": "おお～、バッチリだな！\n本当のお姫様みたいで、響にぴったりだ。", "zh": "哦～，非常合适！简直就像真正的公主一样，和响太相配了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "0d852a97342e9c8d74740f76f42ecf51f7ea9973e6382effc4e13714b7e5ddf5", "ja": "えへへ、自分もすっごく気に入ったぞ！\nお姫様っていうのは、ちょっと照れるけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也特别喜欢！\n说是公主什么的，还是有点害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "86bd56e6fe69e3bf2a9d0c3ab23c94be6f333c4b829d24ea3e9f53a8417b2baf", "ja": "でも、このフリフリな感じが、\nお人形さんみたいで最高にかわいいね♪", "zh": "不过，这种满是荷叶边的感觉，像洋娃娃一样，真是可爱到不行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4b154db3ba3534db6dad81bdfcf00dfa293b354655dfcf595670ae7b9d623ab0", "ja": "喜んでくれてよかったよ。衣装だけでなく、\n撮影のセットもファンシーな感じになるそうだ。", "zh": "你喜欢就好。不仅是服装，\n据说拍摄布景也会是很梦幻的风格哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "c697a6be5e8dd053c3dde2d3340782246678dcfd40f4a0e8edd765c368ed5398", "ja": "そうなの！？　それじゃ、綿あめの国は\n町とか家とかフワフワだったりするのかな～？", "zh": "真的吗！？那棉花糖王国里的街道和房子，也会是软绵绵的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "d456fbab0dd852ac7268bfe10c227a0d6eae978447891005eec0794e0a8e400e", "ja": "人や動物たちもフワフワで……。\nあ、すっごくモフモフした子がいてもいいよね！", "zh": "人和动物们也都软绵绵的……。\n啊，要是有一只毛茸茸得不得了的家伙也不错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1008_p", "source_sha256": "32ccbf48592115c19a30f482eafe5e4bcd2dfd01eb12a71643c4cc0defa22977", "ja": "モ、モフモフ？", "zh": "毛、毛茸茸的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "60f1e456042c8ceaa2481b9b475aadeb381126a13a9f79cef2804e0fb771fcd5", "ja": "うん！　だってモフモフはフワフワの仲間だし！\n触ると、すっごく気持ちがいいでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！因为毛茸茸也是软绵绵的伙伴嘛！\n摸起来特别舒服，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1010_p", "source_sha256": "012690065a21e5c4fcb8198922ec51e9adae4c028ad7ada0eb19662482166021", "ja": "確かに……。触り心地でいえば、\nどちらも幸せな気持ちになるな。", "zh": "确实……说到触感的话，\n两者都会让人感到幸福呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "1db08fe4715f87d990205a3203b282b0301f48afb16dc43dbd758d7bf078d4c6", "ja": "でしょ～！　綿あめの国のお姫様は、\nいつもフワフワに囲まれて幸せなんだね。", "zh": "对吧～！棉花糖王国的公主，总是被松松软软的东西包围着，幸福极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1012_p", "source_sha256": "77c41ba3c5c2054ba174cdf64199aecb7f7372db3c81e9041d6006f70f785af5", "ja": "そうだな。実は最初に資料を読んだ時、\n綿あめの国のお姫様役で、響が思い浮かんだんだ。", "zh": "没错。其实一开始读资料的时候，\n我就想到了让响来演棉花糖王国的公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "9a5d77d3d11c9bd95d1fd38d8ba5586b6d6b86c673440ba66ee90fe1e6b64812", "ja": "自分が……？", "zh": "我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1014_p", "source_sha256": "652ebcd9af5a806a97fbab77d53eac28e7abe2a4a28dbe3d9927f69caeec099f", "ja": "うん。動物に好かれるとこもそうだけど、\nフワフワで可愛い姿が似合うんじゃないかって。", "zh": "嗯。容易讨动物喜欢这一点也是，不过我觉得你应该也很适合毛茸茸又可爱的形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1015_p", "source_sha256": "90d186893f90a573709ea9f68c00c078d69ab5544cd81454d098012f1362bdea", "ja": "響の新しい魅力を出せたらと思ったんだけど……\n間違ってなかったみたいだな。", "zh": "本来是想展现响全新的魅力……看来我没想错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "9abd84d387fca46e4b1d9cb31d25118d30d2319dc667d6a8cc9ef23b18ce9f05", "ja": "そうなんだ……えへへ。\nありがとう、{$P$}。", "zh": "原来是这样……嘿嘿。\n谢谢你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "f0f8cb3fab1a7bc8d3164a1dae91c20b73dd75425e95c5bb5937e506e8d29bcf", "ja": "新しい魅力ってことは、\n自分にも、まだ伸びしろがあるってことだよね？", "zh": "所谓新的魅力，也就是说，\n我自己还有成长的空间，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e61b2e7e2a2db0cc82410ab7f7906bf19447c6690297ef3bee0f8922105b91a5", "ja": "ああ。きっと、響が気づいてない新しい姿が\n眠ってると思う。これからも一緒に探していこう。", "zh": "嗯。响肯定还沉睡着自己尚未察觉到的新面貌。今后也一起去寻找吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "dfa39653805297448e0a14abf81017749569e012bfeb690f3e3ae1642e513730", "ja": "うん！　いつもカンペキな自分でいたいからね。\nよーし、まだまだ頑張るぞ～！", "zh": "嗯！因为我想一直保持最完美的自己嘛。\n好——还要继续加油～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cec62678afc4cdedac74f5c3149a359bf5e6f89dae9cca0f1c8b54b0782bb3f0", "ja": "そうだな。でもまずは綿あめの国のお姫様を頑張ろう。\n……いや。頑張りましょう、ヒビキ姫！", "zh": "是啊。不过首先，先努力成为棉花糖王国的公主吧。\n……不对。让我们一起努力吧，响公主！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1022_p", "source_sha256": "203699dfc886a4d45ca57d9b33cd98df4dd6b43c89f0a56e9b650c6df4664b39", "ja": "お姫様には従者が必要でしょう？\n僭越ながら、私めが……。", "zh": "公主总得有个随从吧？  \n恕我冒昧，就由我来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "201c19fe613ea2093e6e46aaca972051bca069d197164337acd35d837561ad9e", "ja": "うぎゃー！　その口調やめてよ～！\nお、お姫様扱いは恥ずかしいってばー！", "zh": "呜哇——！快别用那种语气说话啦～！\n把、把我当成公主对待也太难为情了吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0394_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ececc505148e61e0ca439b340a13aaae5a9aad664bd6780ead899a6beb293e17", "ja": "（ヒビキ姫の魅力を多くの人に伝えるために頑張らない\nとな。従者……ではなく、プロデューサーとして！）", "zh": "（为了让更多人了解响公主的魅力，得好好加油才行。不，是以制作人的身份，而不是侍从！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
